#: rc.cpp:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Keramik"
msgstr "Keramik"

#: rc.cpp:4
#, no-c-format
msgid "Display the window &icon in the caption bubble"
msgstr "Dat &Lüttbild vun't Finster in de Blaas vun den Titelbalken wiesen"

#: rc.cpp:6
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the window icon to be displayed in the caption "
"bubble next to the titlebar text."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn Du dat Finster-Lüttbild in de Blaas blang den Text vun "
"den Titelbalken wiest kriegen wullt."

#: rc.cpp:8
#, no-c-format
msgid "Draw &small caption bubbles on active windows"
msgstr "För aktive Finstern &lütte Blasen teken"

#: rc.cpp:10
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the caption bubble to have the same size on "
"active windows that it has on inactive ones. This option is useful for "
"laptops or low resolution displays where you want maximize the amount of "
"space available to the window contents."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn de Blaas för aktive Finstern de sülve Grött harrn "
"schall as för nich aktive. Disse Optschoon kannst goot för Klappreekners "
"oder Dorstellen mit bloots ringe Oplösen bruken, wor de verföögbore Platz "
"för den Inholt maximeert warrn schall."

#: rc.cpp:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "Draw g&rab bars below windows"
msgstr "G&reepbalken nerrn de Finstern wiesen"

#: rc.cpp:14
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want a grab bar to be drawn below windows. When "
"this option is not selected only a thin border will be drawn in its place."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn Du en Balken to'n Anfaten nerrn de Finstern hebben wullt. "
"Wenn dit nich aktiveert is, warrt bloots en fienen Rahmen wiest."

#: rc.cpp:16
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use shadowed &text"
msgstr "&Text mit Schadden bruken"

#: rc.cpp:18
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the titlebar text to have a 3D look with a "
"shadow behind it."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn Du wullt, dat de Text op den Titelbalken Schadden hett un "
"denn dreedimenschonaal utsüht."
